        <h2>Nicotine Pouches: Legal Status in the Netherlands</h2>

        <p>Nicotine pouches are <strong>completely legal in the Netherlands</strong>. Unlike traditional snus (which remains banned across the EU except Sweden), tobacco-free nicotine pouches fall outside the <em>Tabaks- en rookwarenwet</em> (Tobacco and Smoking Products Act) because they contain no tobacco leaf. The NVWA (Autoriteit Consument en Markt) monitors the category but has not restricted sales.</p>

        <p>The Dutch pouch market is accelerating. Traditional tobacco shops, convenience stores, and online retailers stock major brands. The category offers a legal, smoke-free alternative in a country with a strong harm-reduction mindset. No age-gate delays, no border customs—just direct access to top global and Scandinavian brands.</p>

        <p>Note: The distinction matters. Marketing as "snus" is illegal (snus is Sweden-only tobacco product). We sell tobacco-free nicotine pouches, which are not snus and are not subject to the same EU restrictions.</p>

        <h2>Top 10 Nicotine Pouches in the Netherlands (2026)</h2>

        <h3>1. ZYN Cool Mint S2</h3>
        <p>The global benchmark for consistency. ZYN Cool Mint delivers a crisp, clean mint with a smooth nicotine feel—3 mg/pouch, discreet white pouch, dissolves cleanly. Best for all-day use and beginners transitioning to pouches. ZYN's quality control and flavor accuracy are unmatched. It's the #1 gateway product in the Netherlands. <a href="/brands/zyn">ZYN brand page</a></p>

        <h3>2. VELO Freeze S4</h3>
        <p>For users who want real strength. VELO Freeze delivers 4 mg/pouch with an intense cooling sensation—think menthol on ice. Fast nicotine release, bold flavour. VELO is the strongest mainstream brand available in Dutch shops. If you want a serious kick, this is it. <a href="/brands/velo">VELO brand page</a></p>

        <h3>3. Nordic Spirit Bergamot Wildberry</h3>
        <p>The most unique flavour in the list. Nordic Spirit blends bergamot (Earl Grey tea) with forest berries—complex, sophisticated, unexpected. 4 mg/pouch, white format. Stands out in a sea of straight mints. For adventurous users who want flavour depth. <a href="/brands/nordic-spirit">Nordic Spirit</a></p>

        <h3>4. LOOP Jalapeno Lime</h3>
        <p>The boldest flavour contender. LOOP Jalapeno Lime is spicy heat meets citrus—3 mg/pouch, organic nicotine, paper-based format. Not for conservative palates, but if you want something that pushes boundaries, this delivers. LOOP is the indie favourite. Jalapeno Lime proves that nicotine pouches can be adventurous.</p>

        <h3>5. Skruf Super White Fresh Mint S2</h3>
        <p>The perfect daily driver. Skruf Super White is a workhorse mint—3 mg/pouch, ultra-thin white pouch, barely noticeable in your mouth, clean finish. No frills, no surprises, just reliable mint every time. Skruf is the discreet professional's choice. Wear it all day without anyone noticing.</p>

        <h3>6. White Fox Peppered Mint</h3>
        <p>The strongest mint option. White Fox Peppered Mint is 4.5 mg/pouch with a peppery undertone—slow, satisfying release. Best for experienced users who want sustained strength without the cooling shock. White Fox is Sweden's premium brand. Peppered Mint is complex: mint-forward but with spice depth.</p>

        <h3>7. Helwit Violet</h3>
        <p>The most unusual pouch in the Netherlands market. Helwit Violet is a floral-sweet profile with a hint of berries—3 mg/pouch, white pouch, completely unexpected. Niche appeal, but cult following. For users bored by mint-or-nothing. Violet proves the category has room for real creativity.</p>

        <h3>8. ON! Coffee</h3>
        <p>The best non-mint option. ON! Coffee is a genuine coffee flavour—3 mg/pouch, brown pouch, aromatic and warm. Perfect for morning use or coffee lovers. Most pouch brands default to mint. ON! Coffee shows that non-mint categories exist and work for daytime rhythm matching.</p>

        <h3>9. Klar Cloudberry</h3>
        <p>The best Scandinavian pick. Klar Cloudberry is a Swedish specialty—rare berries, 4 mg/pouch, white pouch. Scandinavian heritage in every pouch. Limited availability in the Netherlands but worth seeking out. Represents the premium Nordic category. If you appreciate Scandinavian quality, Cloudberry is the flavour to try.</p>

        <h3>10. Fumi Salty Liquorice</h3>
        <p>The most Dutch-friendly choice. Fumi Salty Liquorice is a celebration of Dutch candy culture—salt, liquorice, 4 mg/pouch. The Netherlands has a 200+ year tradition of salt liquorice. This pouch bridges that heritage with modern nicotine. Unique to Dutch market preferences. If you love Dutch drop (liquorice), Fumi is your brand.</p>

