          <h3 class="text-foreground font-semibold mt-4">Zijn nikotinezakjes legaal in Nederland? (Are nicotine pouches legal in the Netherlands?)</h3>
          <p>Yes. Tobacco-free nicotine pouches are legal in the Netherlands. They fall outside the Tobacco and Smoking Products Act because they contain no tobacco. The NVWA monitors the category but has not restricted sales. They are widely available in shops, convenience stores, and online.</p>

          <h3 class="text-foreground font-semibold mt-4">Where can you buy nicotine pouches in the Netherlands?</h3>
          <p>Nicotine pouches are sold in tobacco shops, convenience stores (Albert Heijn, Jumbo), petrol stations, and major online retailers. SnusFriend ships direct from our EU warehouse with 1–2 day delivery and competitive EUR pricing. You can also order from Swedish retailers, but expect 5–7 day transit and potential VAT complications.</p>

          <h3 class="text-foreground font-semibold mt-4">What's the most popular nicotine pouch brand in the Netherlands?</h3>
          <p>ZYN is the market leader globally and in the Netherlands. It's the most stocked brand in Dutch tobacco shops and has the highest repeat-purchase rate. VELO and Nordic Spirit are close second and third. For niche preferences (spicy, fruity, unique flavours), LOOP and Helwit have growing cult followings.</p>

